[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3914614591","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116296#issuecomment-3914614591","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116296","id":3914614591,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pVEc_","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-17T13:07:24Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T13:07:24Z","body":"Can confirm, in both 4.7.dev, in 4.5.1 and 4.6 it just breaks immediately","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3914614591/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3928771933","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116296#issuecomment-3928771933","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116296","id":3928771933,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qLE1d","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-19T17:35:34Z","updated_at":"2026-02-19T17:38:44Z","body":"As mentioned in [the documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_engine.html#class-engine-property-time-scale) of `Engine.time_scale`:\n\n> **Note:** This does not automatically adjust [physics_ticks_per_second](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_engine.html#class-engine-property-physics-ticks-per-second). With values above 1.0 physics simulation may become less precise, as each physics tick will stretch over a larger period of engine time. If you're modifying [time_scale](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_engine.html#class-engine-property-time-scale) to speed up simulation by a large factor, consider also increasing [physics_ticks_per_second](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_engine.html#class-engine-property-physics-ticks-per-second) to make the simulation more reliable.\n\nSetting `Engine.physics_ticks_per_second` to `120` when you set `Engine.time_scale` to `2.0` would preserve the same physics time step, and seems to resolve the issue of the simulation exploding.\n\nI'll leave it to @jrouwe to say whether it's expected that the simulation does explode at 30 hz. I get the sense that the combination of a very low mass, low damping and high pressure might make this more volatile, but I'm mostly just guessing.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3928771933/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3940639115","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116296#issuecomment-3940639115","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116296","id":3940639115,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7q4WGL","user":{"login":"jrouwe","id":1621693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjE2OTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1621693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe","html_url":"https://github.com/jrouwe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-22T10:12:24Z","updated_at":"2026-02-22T10:12:24Z","body":"The system is too stiff to be simulated at 30 Hz. There are 2 possible fixes:\n\n* Reduce the `Linear Stiffness` parameter to make the system less stiff. 0.3 seems to be stable.\n* Increase the `Simulation Precision` from 5 to 10 at the moment you change the time scale to 2.0. This effectively keeps the internal delta time per step the same. Note that setting the `Simulation Precision` to 10 seems to be unstable at 60 Hz with a `Linear Stiffness` of 0.5 (it works for lower settings).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3940639115/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3940647383","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116296#issuecomment-3940647383","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116296","id":3940647383,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7q4YHX","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-22T10:17:48Z","updated_at":"2026-02-22T10:17:48Z","body":"It sounds like there's nothing more we can do on the engine side then, so I'll go ahead and close this.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3940647383/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]